T01 | Created src/api/generationClient.js with all required generation API client functions | 30m
DESC Create the generation API client module. Exports: loadGenerationModels(), loadGenerationCredits(), loadGenerationJobs(), launchGenerationJob(payload), retryGenerationJob(jobId). Mirror the requestJson/parseJson pattern from publishingClient.js. All endpoints are under /api/v1/generation/.
